@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000/api

# Substitua pelo id retornado na criação/listagem
@taskId = cole_o_id_aqui

### Health check
GET {{baseUrl}}/health

### Listar tarefas (primeira página)
GET {{baseUrl}}/tasks?page=1&limit=10

### Filtrar por status e prioridade
GET {{baseUrl}}/tasks?status=pendente&priority=alta

### Busca textual
GET {{baseUrl}}/tasks?search=estudar

### Ordenar por prazo
GET {{baseUrl}}/tasks?sort=due&limit=20

### Estatísticas
GET {{baseUrl}}/tasks/stats

### Buscar tarefa por id
GET {{baseUrl}}/tasks/{{taskId}}

### Criar tarefa
POST {{baseUrl}}/tasks
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Estudar Node.js",
  "description": "Revisar middlewares e tratamento de erros",
  "status": "pendente",
  "priority": "alta",
  "dueDate": "2026-11-05"
}

### Atualizar tarefa
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/tasks/{{taskId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Estudar Node.js e Express",
  "priority": "media"
}

### Concluir tarefa
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/tasks/{{taskId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "concluida"
}

### Remover tarefa
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/tasks/{{taskId}}
